        "parameters": {
          "content": "# 03 — Calendly → Twenty Opportunity\\nReceives invitee.created, finds the persisted lead by email, and updates its Twenty opportunity. The workflow introspects OpportunityStageEnum first instead of hard-coding a stage.",
